  partName: Gasket (4)
  description: The Gasket (4) is another tiny, thin-flat gasket made of Material.001,
    located at the middle-center-center of the engine, responsible for sealing and
    separating engine components. Its tiny size and strategic position make it a
    vital component in maintaining engine integrity. Notably, the Gasket (4) is designed
    to withstand high temperatures and pressures, ensuring reliable engine operation.
